&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with game designers, visual designers, engineers, producers, and QA to ship polished experiences from concept through implementation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with engineers to ensure UX designs are feasible, resilient across edge cases, and optimized for platform constraints on PC and mobile.&lt;/li&gt;
