&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of professional experience in UX design, product design, interaction design, or a similar player-facing digital product role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing and shipping consumer-facing digital products, game features, or live-service experiences.&lt;/li&gt;
