&lt;li class=&quot;p3&quot;&gt;As a 3D lead on the team, you will oversee and be accountable for the quality of the work the team delivers and set the bar for excellence.&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
